\b\f1\insrsid15008363  What are the major weaknesses of exogenous growth theory? Which theory was developed in against of exogenous growth theory?
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\insrsid15008363 ANSWER:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\ul\insrsid15008363 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af44\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs22\ul\insrsid15008363 EXOGENOUS GROWTH THEORY:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\insrsid15008363 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs22\insrsid15008363 The Exogenous growth model, also known as the Neo-classical growth model or Solow growth model is
\par a term used to sum up the contributions of various authors to a model of long-run economic growth
\par within the framework of neoclassical economics.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\insrsid15008363 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af43\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f43\fs22\insrsid15008363 Exogenous growth theory suffered from three major weaknesses:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af44\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs22\insrsid15008363 i. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs22\insrsid15008363 It could not explain why the gap between the poor and rich countries had widened (anticatch
\par up),
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af44\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs22\insrsid15008363 ii. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs22\insrsid15008363 It could not explain why some countries in East Asia had apparently grown consistently
\par on the back of higher saving rates, and
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af44\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs22\insrsid15008363 iii. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs22\insrsid15008363 It modeled technology as exogenous, and beyond the influence of policy.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af43\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f43\fs22\ul\insrsid15008363 PART B SOLUTION:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs22\insrsid15008363 
\par In economics, }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af44\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs22\insrsid15008363 endogenous growth theory }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs22\insrsid15008363 or }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af44\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs22\insrsid15008363 
new growth theory }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs22\insrsid15008363 was developed in the 1980s as a
