\par 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af44\afs32 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs32\ul\insrsid15008363 THE BALANCE OF PAYMENTS (BOP):}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af44\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs22\insrsid15008363 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs22\insrsid15008363 BOP is an accounting record of a country\rquote s transactions with the rest of the world.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs26 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\fs26\cf2\insrsid15008363 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs22\insrsid15008363 The balance of payments (or BOP) measures the payments that flow between any individual country
\par and all other countries. It is used to summarize all international economic transactions for that country
\par during a specific time period, usually a year.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af43\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f43\fs22\insrsid15008363 PART B SOLUTION:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf2\insrsid15008363 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\tx0\tx504\tx864\tx1224\tx1584\tqr\tx9605\wrapdefault{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1\afs32 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\fs32\ul\insrsid15008363 
How the BOP can be determined?
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\insrsid15008363 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf11\insrsid15008363 IT CAN BE DETERMINED IN THE FOLLOWING WAY:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf2\insrsid15008363 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs22\insrsid15008363 The BOP is determined by the country's exports and
\par imports of goods, services, and financial capital, as well as financial transfers. It reflects all payments
\par and liabilities to foreigners (debits) and all payments and obligations received from foreigners (credits).
\par Balance of payments is one of the major indicators of a country's status in international trade, with net
\par capital outflow.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid15008363 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\insrsid15008363 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\insrsid15008363   }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid15008363 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\insrsid15008363 Question No: 50    ( Marks: 3 ) 
