07000000fc020100000000000000040000002d0102000800000025030200040003005f0e030008000000fa0200000000000000000000040000002d0103000700
0000fc020000ffffff000000040000002d01040004000000f0010100040000002701ffff1c000000fb021000070000000000bc02000000000102022253797374656d000000000000fd99807c58bd1e0010f9230070bb1e005ae78339040000002d010100030000000000}}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\f1\insrsid15008363  World Bank suggests some structural reform policies for the poor countries to grow. Discuss those policies briefly.
\par Ans:
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af44\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs22\insrsid15008363 
\par 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf1\insrsid15008363 World Bank has suggested following policies for the poor countries to grow,
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15008363 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\ul\cf1\insrsid15008363 Governance and administrative reforms:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15008363  
\par To reduce over employment in public sector, reduce wastes and to improve the quality and reliability of public services. To strengthen the administration of taxes, to eliminate the corruption. To decentralize the control of fiscal policy making. To enrich
 the legal and regulator framework.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\ul\cf1\insrsid15008363 Privatization of state-owned enterprises:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15008363  Abbreviated as SOEs. These are influenced by political interference and it is one of the reasons SOEs are considered inefficient. SOEs are also suffering form lack of competition
, cost awareness and fear of bankruptcy.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\ul\cf1\insrsid15008363 Financial liberalization:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15008363   It involves ending of financial repression policies including artificially low interest rates, credit rationing, restrictions on banking competition and government involvement in investment allocation

\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\ul\cf1\insrsid15008363 Deregulation involving dismantling of licensing systems and red-tape}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15008363 
\par  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\ul\cf1\insrsid15008363 Trade liberalization:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15008363  
\par including tariffication of non-tariff-barriers, harmonization of tariffs and an eventual reduction thereof
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\ul\cf1\insrsid15008363 FDI liberalization:  
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15008363 To create a transparent, predictable environment for foreign investors to operate in. 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\ul\cf1\insrsid15008363 apital account liberalization:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15008363  
\par  To remove controls on capital flows
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\tx1320\wrapdefault{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs22\cf1\insrsid15008363 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15008363 
(These policies are suggested by world bank and the successful implementation of these policies depend on the political and economic system of poor countries. In general these policies are expected to provide the poor nation with better understanding and 
help them to raise their growth.)}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf1\insrsid15008363 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\insrsid15008363     }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\insrsid15008363 
\par Question No: 50    ( Marks: 3 ) 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\fs20\insrsid13390255 {\pict{\*\picprop\shplid1035{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 75}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLine}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}
