\b\insrsid15008363  It is said that growth is an important macroeconomic issue. Why? Discuss.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15008363 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15008363     ANSWER:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af44\afs32 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs32\ul\insrsid15008363 Why Growth is an Important Macroeconomic Issue:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af44\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs22\insrsid15008363 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs22\insrsid15008363 It is obvious why growth is an important macroeconomic issue. Every government aspires to deliver a
\par higher growth rate for the country. High growth rates means higher national income which means better
\par living standards on average, which in democracies, means happier electorates and therefore increased
\par chances of re-election for another term in office. However, while all countries might wish to achieve
\par high growth rates, in practice, only a handful have been able to convert the wish into reality.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid15008363 
\par Question No: 50    ( Marks: 3 ) 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\fs20\insrsid13390255 {\pict{\*\picprop\shplid1043{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 75}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLine}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}
