\b\insrsid15008363  What are the different borrowing options available to the government for reducing the fiscal deficit?}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15008363 
\par     }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs22\insrsid15008363 By borrowing locally (i.e. issuing bonds), foreign financing (including non-relpayable grants) or printing
\par money (i.e. borrowing from the central bank). The first of these methods is least inflationary while the last
\par one is most inflationary.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid15008363 
\par Question No: 52    ( Marks: 5 ) 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\tx720\wrapdefault{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\fs20\insrsid13390255 
