\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15008363  is called }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf1\insrsid15008363 demand-pull inflation}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15008363 
. Such an inflation may arise from any individual factor that increases aggregate demand, but the main ones that generate }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\cf1\insrsid15008363 ongoing}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15008363 
 increases in aggregate demand are :
