\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15008363 Inflation can result from a decrease in }{\field{\*\fldinst {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15008363 HYPERLINK "http://economics.about.com/library/glossary/bldef-aggregate-supply.htm"}{\rtlch\fcs1 
